{"id":"7bc072a211934ba8","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-loop.md","title":"Loop","display":"df-loop — Loop","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-loop","aliases":["58-df-loop","Loop"],"display":"df-loop — Loop","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[58-df-path]]","[[58-df-basepoint]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-homotopy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-loop"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-loop</span><span>Loop</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-loop — Loop"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"600d3de34015fa31\" href=\"?note=600d3de34015fa31\" title=\"58-df-path\">58-df-path</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a59bfe71b12356d\" href=\"?note=5a59bfe71b12356d\" title=\"58-df-basepoint\">58-df-basepoint</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"58-df-homotopy\">58-df-homotopy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Concat}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{Concat}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Loop}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{Loop}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span> with its usual topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I\">\\(\\tau_I\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta\\in X^I\">\\(\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta\\in X^I\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in X\">\\(x_0\\in X\\)</span> (base point)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Loop}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Loop}_S\\)</span> (defined here; loop predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S\\)</span> (based homotopy predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Concat}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Concat}_S\\)</span> (loop concatenation predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (continuous-map predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)\\)</span>，取所引内部实子空间拓扑定义的唯一值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}square\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\tau_{I^2}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq I\\times I:\n\\forall\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_I\\;\n(t\\in U\\land s\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}square\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\tau_{I^2}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq I\\times I:\n\\forall\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_I\\;\n(t\\in U\\land s\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\gamma\\in X^I\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,I,\\tau_I,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\gamma\\in X^I\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,I,\\tau_I,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\exists H\\in X^{I\\times I}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,I\\times I,\\tau_{I^2},X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;(H(t,0)=\\gamma(t)\\land H(t,1)=\\eta(t))\\land\\forall s\\in I\\;(H(0,s)=x_0\\land H(1,s)=x_0)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\exists H\\in X^{I\\times I}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,I\\times I,\\tau_{I^2},X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;(H(t,0)=\\gamma(t)\\land H(t,1)=\\eta(t))\\land\\forall s\\in I\\;(H(0,s)=x_0\\land H(1,s)=x_0)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{Concat}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\bigl((t\\leq \\tfrac12\\to\\delta(t)=\\gamma(2t))\\land(t\\geq \\tfrac12\\to\\delta(t)=\\eta(2t-1))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{Concat}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\bigl((t\\leq \\tfrac12\\to\\delta(t)=\\gamma(2t))\\land(t\\geq \\tfrac12\\to\\delta(t)=\\eta(2t-1))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Loop: closed path; starts and ends at same point</li>\n<li>Fundamental group: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(X,x_0)\">\\(\\pi_1(X,x_0)\\)</span> of loops modulo homotopy</li>\n<li>Based homotopy: all loops fixed at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span> during homotopy; the square's product topology is now a set-builder definition rather than an unregistered tensor symbol.</li>\n<li>Homology: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1(X) \\cong \\pi_1(X)^{ab}\">\\(H_1(X) \\cong \\pi_1(X)^{ab}\\)</span>; abelianization of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-path","status":"resolved","id":"600d3de34015fa31","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-path]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-basepoint","status":"resolved","id":"5a59bfe71b12356d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-basepoint]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homotopy","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homotopy]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Concat}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Loop}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"I=[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta\\in X^I","display":false},{"tex":"x_0\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Loop}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Concat}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unit\\text{-}square\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\tau_{I^2}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq I\\times I:\n\\forall\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_I\\;\n(t\\in U\\land s\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\gamma\\in X^I\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,I,\\tau_I,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_0","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\exists H\\in X^{I\\times I}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,I\\times I,\\tau_{I^2},X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;(H(t,0)=\\gamma(t)\\land H(t,1)=\\eta(t))\\land\\forall s\\in I\\;(H(0,s)=x_0\\land H(1,s)=x_0)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop} \\vdash \\mathrm{Concat}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\bigl((t\\leq \\tfrac12\\to\\delta(t)=\\gamma(2t))\\land(t\\geq \\tfrac12\\to\\delta(t)=\\eta(2t-1))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_1(X,x_0)","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"H_1(X) \\cong \\pi_1(X)^{ab}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1","display":false}],"bytes":2860,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Loop}_S$, $\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S$, and $\\mathrm{Concat}_S$ (see [[58-df-loop]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-801","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-loop.md|58-df-loop]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["3b5b3d48ff1ff369","600d3de34015fa31","5a59bfe71b12356d","3cd1834de4f2efb2","815e63e5071e7b58","cc1ce993dd3ce56d"]}